  "limitations": [
    "4096-shape batch limit. Duplicate tokens reject, empty batch is no-op after validation. Native 64-bit high bits/nonzero groupIndex unsupported, never silently truncated.",
    "Only actual managed sphere/box finite geometry and limited contact/sensor lifecycle qualified. No arbitrary compound/mesh/heightfield acceptance.",
    "mutationOutcome is optional only on reviewed body/filter paths. Outer disposed/reentrant exclusive guards remain unannotated; absence must be treated conservatively.",
    "Readback/call-delivery failures are explicitly injected wrappers around real native state, not claimed spontaneous native faults; actual committed values and unchanged nativeStepIndex were read back.",
    "128 reuse cycles and one actual heap replacement are finite evidence, not universal no-ABA/no-leak proof.",
    "No new persistent native filter allocation; temporary WASM buffers are freed, but core byteCount/bridge counters do not cover all JS or WASM heap memory.",
    "UBSan-only does not establish ASan/LSan PASS; browser/CSP limits remain unchanged. Public AIR adapter integration is independently owned."
  ],
